-- Phase 8: seed the global food catalog from USDA FoodData Central.
--
-- Source
--   Dataset          : USDA FoodData Central (SR Legacy)
--   Publisher        : U.S. Department of Agriculture, Agricultural Research Service
--   Release          : April 2018 (final release of Standard Reference Legacy)
--   URL              : https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/fdc-datasets/FoodData_Central_sr_legacy_food_csv_2018-04.zip
--   ZIP SHA-256      : B80817294B8850530AAEDF2E515C02593B1824F763A0FF356E5C2081643E6FD0
--
-- Generators and rules. All are versioned: changing any of them requires a NEW
-- migration rather than an edit to this file, because V9 may already be applied.
--   Generator        : 1.0.0
--   Category mapping : 1.0
--   Brand filter     : 1.0
--   UUID namespace   : 6ba7b810-9dad-11d1-80b4-00c04fd430c8 (RFC 4122 DNS namespace)
--   UUID formula     : UUIDv5(namespace, 'fdc:<numeric fdc id>')
--
-- Nutrition basis
--   Every value below is PER 100 GRAMS, taken verbatim from food_nutrient.amount,
--   whose field definition in the source workbook reads "Amount of the nutrient per
--   100g of food." No unit conversion and no rounding is applied here; the server
--   scales by grams/100 in NutritionCalculator at scale 2 HALF_UP.
--   serving_size and serving_unit are DISPLAY METADATA ONLY and are deliberately
--   not a nutrition denominator.
--
-- Data quality
--   Records missing any of the seven required nutrients were REJECTED, never
--   zero-filled or imputed. Branded and manufacturer-specific products were
--   excluded even though they sit inside SR Legacy, because that data type does
--   include proprietary formulations.
--
